@startuml
title CommU Dataset Generation

hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "Storage" as Storage
participant "Lucy 2.6" as Lucy
participant "DINOv3\nPose Estimation" as Dino

Storage -> Lucy: Source videos + CommU reference image
activate Lucy
Lucy -> Lucy: Generate robot videos
Lucy -> Dino: Resulting robot videos
deactivate Lucy
activate Dino
Dino -> Dino: Estimate robot joint positions
Dino --> Storage: Joint positions for each video frame
deactivate Dino

@enduml
